### RailFlow API Verification REST Client File
# Use this file with VS Code REST Client extension, or translate to curl commands.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@deviceFingerprint = user-chrome-windows-fingerprint-999

### 1. Root Check
GET http://localhost:5000/
Accept: application/json

### 2. User Registration (Passenger)
# @name registerPassenger
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testpassenger@railflow.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "Passenger"
}

### 3. User Login (Passenger - Standard)
# @name loginPassenger
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "passenger@railflow.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Save Passenger Token (Copy from login response into this variable)
@passengerToken = {{loginPassenger.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Fetch Passenger Profile (Requires Auth Header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### 5. Fetch Saved Passengers List (Masked Aadhaar Check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### 6. Save a New Passenger (Field-Level Encryption Check)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Smith",
  "aadhaar": "987654321098"
}

### 7. Search Trains (Fuzzy Match Check - "Mumbay" instead of "Mumbai")
GET {{baseUrl}}/trains/search?from=Mumbay&to=Delhi&date=2026-06-15
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### 8. Get Train Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/trains/12951

### 9. Get Live Seat Layout (Coach B1 - 3A)
GET {{baseUrl}}/trains/12951/coach?class=3A

### 10. Attempt to Lock Seat WITHOUT Virtual Queue (Fails with 403 Redirect Queue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trainNumber": "12951",
  "coachLabel": "B1",
  "seatNumbers": [5, 6]
}

### 11. Join the Virtual Queue
# @name joinQueue
POST {{baseUrl}}/queue/join
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceFingerprint": "{{deviceFingerprint}}"
}

### Save Queue Token (Copy from response data.token)
@queueToken = {{joinQueue.response.body.data.token}}

### 12. Poll Queue Status (Advance Queue simulation)
# Wait a few seconds and run this to watch position degrade.
# Tampering is protected: altering token relative to IP/fingerprint results in 30-min ban.
GET {{baseUrl}}/queue/status?token={{queueToken}}&deviceFingerprint={{deviceFingerprint}}
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### 13. Lock Seat WITH Virtual Queue (Run after queue position reaches 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trainNumber": "12951",
  "coachLabel": "B1",
  "seatNumbers": [5, 6]
}

### 14. Confirm Booking (Runs Saga Orchestrator & Payment Simulation)
# Set unique Idempotency key per request to prevent double submit.
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trainNumber": "12951",
  "coachLabel": "B1",
  "seatNumbers": [5, 6],
  "passengers": [
    {
      "name": "Jane Doe",
      "age": 28,
      "gender": "F",
      "aadhaar": "111122223333"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bob Smith",
      "age": 42,
      "gender": "M",
      "aadhaar": "987654321098"
    }
  ],
  "paymentMethod": "UPI",
  "idempotencyKey": "unique-payment-idempotency-key-001"
}

### 15. Retrieve E-Ticket (PNR Check)
# Replace PNR with actual PNR from booking confirm response
@pnr = 1234567890
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/ticket/{{pnr}}
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### 16. Check Booking History
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/history
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### 17. User Session Terminate (Force Logout check)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/sessions/terminate
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### 18. Admin Login (Requires MFA Bypass)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@railflow.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Save Admin MFA Token (MFA authentication token returned)
@adminMfaToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.mfaToken}}

### 19. Verify MFA Code for Admin
# @name verifyAdminMfa
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/mfa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@railflow.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Save Admin Access Token
@adminToken = {{verifyAdminMfa.response.body.accessToken}}

### 20. Access Admin Analytics Dashboard (Requires adminToken + MFA verification check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 21. Access Admin Queue Monitoring Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/queue-metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 22. Access Service Health Grid (OpenTelemetry telemetry simulation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/service-health
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 23. Access Security Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 24. Token Blacklist / Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
